  "steps": [
    "To a pan on medium heat add 1 tsp oil, 1/2 tsp mustard seeds, 1/2 tsp cumin seeds, 1/4 tsp hing, 10 curry leaves, 2 slit green chillies, 1 chopped onion, Sauté till golden brown.",
    "Meanwhile, to a mortar and pestle add 6 cloves of garlic, 1 tsp Kashmiri red chilli powder, 15ml water, Crush it all into a paste and add it to the pan.",
    "Now add 1 tsp coriander powder, 1/4 tsp turmeric powder, 1/2 tsp cumin powder, 1 tsp garam masala, Mix everything well and let it cook for 2 min.",
    "Then add half a handful of chopped coriander, give it a final mix and switch off the flame.",
    "Once cooled, I added 500g high-protein yogurt (350g is what’s recommend), 1 tsp salt, Mix everything really well and it’s ready to serve!"
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The creator used 500 g high-protein yogurt; the original recipe recommends 350 g."
  ],
